              "id": 17803593,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 146.0\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://block.xyz/news\n2. Observe the cards that have only text, no other elements\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nText is rendered correctly\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nText is rendered squeezed\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/194474",
